@startuml
actor User
participant "Login Page (UI)" as UI
participant "SupabaseAuthService" as Auth
participant "Supabase API" as Supabase
database "Database (RPC)" as DB
participant "LocalStorage" as LS

User -> UI: Enter Email, Password, Remember Me
UI -> UI: Validate Form Data
UI -> Auth: loginUser(email, password)
Auth -> Supabase: auth.signInWithPassword({email, password})
Supabase --> Auth: User Data & Session
Auth -> DB: log_user_action('login')
DB --> Auth: Acknowledgment
Auth --> UI: Success Response
UI -> LS: Store/Remove Remember Email
UI -> User: Redirect to Dashboard
@enduml
